Ut3KuymQa2lf3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUhBFOi2EvG1kqQTDvrMUioSX-HsI44QLxsFbZnFg7HyA&oe=6B0EF738"}, "display_name": "Pastel Gallery", "keywords": [], "long_description": "- Full gallery with over 300 pastel paintings from the award winning artist Dr. James Southworth\n- Beautiful paintings from around the world including beautiful countryside and urban locations in Europe, the Northwest USA and more (Oregon, Washington, France, Italy, Turkey)\n- Paintings include stunning landscapes and pastel colors, as well as cityscapes and people\n- Additional bonus paintings in pastel and other art mediums by Dr. Southworth and ZOSU\n- Includes mini-game to locate all of the artifacts\n- Includes bonus features with the ability to draw on a set of canvases and to be able to climb on most objects\n- Paintings scaled for maximum VR effectiveness\n- All paintings based on direct onsite inspiration of the painted content\n- Produced my solo indie hobby studios ZOSU Studios LLC", "short_description": "- Full gallery with over 300 pastel paintings from the award winning artist Dr. James Southworth\n- Beautiful paintings from around the world including beautiful locations in Europe the Northwest USA and more\n- Additional bonus paintings in pastel and other art mediums by Dr. Southworth and ZOSU\n- Includes mini-game to locate all of the artifacts\n- Includes bonus feature with ability to draw on a set of canvases\n- Produced my solo indie hobby studios ZOSU Studios LLC"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.zosustudio.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.zosustudio.com/", "publisher_name": "ZOSU Studios LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.zosustudios.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1819